## Why This Is Asked
Tests ability to design privacy-preserving ML pipelines across tenants with governance constraints. It also probes how to coordinate training, model registry, and DR while controlling cost.

## Key Concepts
- Federated learning across tenants
- Azure ML orchestration and Delta Lake
- Purview RBAC BYOK governance
- Drift monitoring and auditability
- DR and cost optimization

## Code Example
```javascript
// Pseudocode for federated training loop
function train_round(tenant_config, local_data_uri, model, aggregator_uri){
  const local_model = train(model, load(local_data_uri));
  const update = compute_update(local_model, model);
  send_update_to_server(aggregator_uri, update);
}
```

## Follow-up Questions
- How would you detect and respond to drift across tenants?
- How would you handle non-IID data and stragglers in the federation?

## Why This Is Asked
The new angle emphasizes auditability and per‑tenant isolation in a beginner‑friendly Azure stack, testing grasp of streaming ingestion, lightweight validation, data lake organization, curated analytics, row‑level security, immutable auditing, BYOK, and DR considerations.

## Key Concepts
- Event Hubs ingestion
- Azure Functions for validation/enrichment
- Per‑tenant isolation in ADLS Gen2
- Synapse curated views per tenant
- Power BI row‑level security
- Immutable audit logs in Cosmos DB
- Simple cross‑region DR (paired region)
- BYOK with Key Vault
- Cost levers: autoscale, data tiering, on‑demand compute

## Code Example

```javascript
// Azure Function: parse and enrich event
module.exports = async function(context, event) {
  const payload = typeof event === 'string' ? JSON.parse(event) : event;
  if (!payload.tenantId || !payload.eventType) throw new Error('Invalid');
  payload.ingestedAt = new Date().toISOString();
  payload.source = payload.source || 'ingest';
  return payload;
}
```

## Follow-up Questions
- How would you enforce immutable auditing and retention across regions?
- How would you design per‑tenant access controls and data governance in this pipeline?

## Why This Is Asked
The angle tests end-to-end design under regulatory constraints, real-time data flows, and cross-region DR.

## Key Concepts
- Real-time ingestion: MQTT → IoT Hub → Stream Analytics
- Consent governance and policy engine
- Data isolation: per-tenant Cosmos DB & Data Lake Gen2
- BYOK, Purview RBAC, GDPR/HIPAA readiness
- DR across paired EU regions; cost levers: reserved capacity, tiered storage

## Code Example
```javascript
function redactPII(record) {
  if (!record) return record;
  const r = { ...record };
  if (r.ssn) r.ssn = 'XXX-XX-XXXX';
  if (r.dob) r.dob = null;
  if (r.phone) r.phone = r.phone.replace(/\d(?=\d{4})/g, '*');
  return r;
}
```

